        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "loc_tai_bai_blessed_land",
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feathermen are born with cloud path dao marks, are skilled at flying, and their elites are flying masters.",
      "chapters": [
        866
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feathermen-and-gained-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "race_feathermen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if featherman Gu Immortals do not primarily cultivate cloud path, killing them yields a good number of cloud path dao marks that can be added to a blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        866
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feathermen-and-gained-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A soft cloud-like immortal material contains a huge amount of cloud path dao marks. It is a fragment of an immemorial desolate beast cloud phoenix, and the cloud path dao marks inside can serve as the main material to refine a rank six Immortal Gu at least ten times.",
      "chapters": [
        936
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cloud-phoenix-fragment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ancient cloud beasts leave Fang Yuan with bone-deep injuries where cloud path dao marks gather and spill white clouds constantly.",
      "chapters": [
        1044
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marks-spilling-white-clouds",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the spear tip bamboo forest of cloud bamboo mountain range, most lifeforms have cloud path dao marks. The largest group is cloud foxes, snow-white foxes that can float in the air temporarily.",
      "chapters": [
        1590
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cloud-fox-mountain-range",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cloud ladder trees are rank seven immortal plants with dense wood path and cloud path dao marks. Every hundred years a tree grows by ten inches, one step of a ladder.",
      "chapters": [
        1890
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
